<title>USA: Northern Trust Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Northern Trust Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.62		    $0.52</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.62		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			 71,700		   61,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     114,649		  114,982</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     114,651		  115,845</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 provision for credit losses $500,000 vs $5.0 million.  </p>
<p>Q1 1997 total non-interest income $208.7 million including $157.7 million in trust fees vs $187.7 million including $143.9 million in trust fees.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net interest income $106.1 million vs $93.4 million.</p>
<p>Assets $23.23 billion vs $20.30 billion</p>
<p>Loans and leases $11.42 billion vs $10.03 billion</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
